{
  "about": "veffrosion: a degrader in the spirit of Ableton's Erosion, in the unit's own lists of effects (sounds and master) and on fx train's wagons. A 0.5 ms delay whose read wobbles by a sine or band-passed noise at FREQ; the wobble's sidebands are added to the whole dry sound. Knobs: freq (30 Hz..18 kHz), width, amount, mix; with shift held: mode (sine, noise, wide) and tone. Stands on delay; changes no place of the firmware; needs the base.",
